the value is invalid. if the ont authentication mode is once-on, the default is snPassword.
Options:
1. sn(1) -Indicate the re-register type of the ont is sn authentication type
2. snPassword(2) -Indicate the re-register type of the ont is snPassword authentication type
3. invalid(-1) -Indicate the re-register type of the ont is invalid"
    ::= { 1 3 6 1 4 1 2011 6 128 1 1 2 43 1 15 }

hwGponDeviceOntInfoAuthEffectMode OBJECT-TYPE
